                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "While visually striking, I ultimately found this game uncompelling. At times I'd be interested in what was coming next, but obtuse \"puzzles\" of recording specific environmental codes is just needless friction. I used a guide for these codes, since this element was far from additive to the experience, but then the grand finale expects you to recall exactly what selections you made when you thought you were just making cool music and freestyling. The buildup almost changed my opinion, but doubling down on entering codes sealed my conclusion as unnecessarily obstructive.",
